_(ICSE ’24), April 14–20, 2024, Lisbon, Portugal._ ACM, New York, NY, USA,
13 pages. https://doi _._ org/10 _._ [1145/3597503](https://doi.org/10.1145/3597503.3639128) _._ 3639128


